# Angular component files

Do not put HTML or CSS inline in `.ts` files.

## Pages (features)

- `{name}.page.ts` with `templateUrl: './{name}.html'` and `styleUrls: ['./{name}.scss']`
- Companion files: `{name}.html`, `{name}.scss`

## Other UI components

- Prefer `{name}.component.ts` + `{name}.component.html` + `{name}.component.scss`
- Or the shorter `{name}.ts` + `{name}.html` + `{name}.scss` when colocated under `shared/components` or a feature widget folder

Never use `template:` or `styles:` for product UI components.

Exception: none for product UI. Specs and generated docs are not components.
